        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Anima with LoRAs\n\n[Anima](https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima) Base v1.0 (CircleStone Labs with Comfy Org, 2B, Qwen3 0.6B text\nencoder, Qwen-Image VAE): anime and illustration text-to-image, trained on anime images only. The plain workflow,\nwithout custom nodes; `image_anima_full` adds ControlNet, a reference and Hires. fix.\n\n**Settings**: 30 steps (32-40 for finals), CFG 4-4.5 (true CFG, the negative prompt works), er_sde, simple\n(normal is the card's choice), Shift 3 (**ModelSamplingAuraFlow**), 1024×1024 (512-1536 per side, multiples of 16).\nTurbo: 10 steps, CFG 1, euler; the negative prompt then has little effect.\n\n**Prompts**: Danbooru tags and prose in one prompt, in the card's order\n`[quality/meta/safety] [count] [character] [series] [@artist] [general tags]`: start with\n`masterpiece, best quality, score_7, safe,` and write at least two full sentences for a consistent style. Weights are\nstrong: use `(word:2)` where SDXL takes `(word:1.2)`. Anima does not do realism.\n\n## Image Bench\n\n| Marker | Node | Generate tab |\n|--------|------|--------------|\n| `ib:cp` | Load Diffusion Model | model list, model exploration |\n| `ib:pp` / `ib:np` | Image Bench Prompt / Negative Prompt | prompts and LoRA list |\n| `ib:smp` | KSampler | seed, steps, CFG scale, sampling method, schedule type; Shift (ModelSamplingAuraFlow); size (Width / Height) |\n| `ib:lora` | Load LoRA (bypassed) | LoRA exploration only |\n\n**LoRAs**: check them in the LoRA list of the Generate tab, or type `<lora:name:weight>` into the prompt; the **Image\nBench Prompt** node applies them to the model and the text encoder. **Load LoRA** stays bypassed; LoRA exploration\nenables it for its runs and bypasses it again.\n\n## Model Links\n\n**diffusion_models**: [anima-base-v1.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/anima-base-v1.0.safetensors)\n(the Turbo and Aesthetic fine-tunes are in the same repository and load the same way)\n**text_encoders**: [qwen_3_06b_base.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_06b_base.safetensors)\n**vae**: [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors)\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n└── 📂 models/\n    ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n    │   └── anima-base-v1.0.safetensors\n    ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n    │   └── qwen_3_06b_base.safetensors\n    └── 📂 vae/\n        └── qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n```\n\nAnima is under the CircleStone Labs non-commercial license.\n"
      ],
      "title": "Note: Anima with LoRAs",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
